3
00:00:07,780 --> 00:00:10,420
Why has this year been so hard?

4
00:00:10,660 --> 00:00:12,590
Is there anything I should be aware of?

5
00:00:12,780 --> 00:00:15,730
The cards are used here as a structured map for

6
00:00:15,730 --> 00:00:19,610
reflection, not as a prediction and not a crystal ball

7
00:00:19,610 --> 00:00:23,730
with better branding. This reading shows how the answer connects

8
00:00:23,790 --> 00:00:26,080
