9
00:00:26,080 --> 00:00:30,130
Politely ignore the rest. The birth card is the eight

10
00:00:30,130 --> 00:00:35,450
of diamonds. The eight is power, direction and mastery.

11
00:00:35,740 --> 00:00:40,540
Diamonds deal with value, resources, money, priorities and self-worth.

12
00:00:40,780 --> 00:00:45,760
At its best, this card can organise resources, take responsibility

13
00:00:45,760 --> 00:00:49,760
and turn effort into something you can actually point at.

14
00:00:49,900 --> 00:00:53,780
The hard side appears when effort becomes the only personality

15
00:00:53,780 --> 00:00:58,190
trait left. If something feels uncertain, the eight of diamonds

16
00:00:58,230 --> 00:01:01,890
may try to control more, carry more or work harder

17
00:01:01,890 --> 00:01:04,250
as if the universe were a group chat that just

18
00:01:04,370 --> 00:01:06,860
needs one more perfectly worded message.

19
00:01:06,860 --> 00:01:09,670
A difficult year can start to feel like a personal

20
00:01:09,900 --> 00:01:14,080
performance review instead of information about what needs to change.

21
00:01:14,220 --> 00:01:17,680
The planetary ruling card is the five of clubs.

22
00:01:17,820 --> 00:01:21,530
The five is change, freedom and adaptation.

23
00:01:21,530 --> 00:01:27,160
Clubs deal with thought, communication, ideas and creativity.

24
00:01:27,340 --> 00:01:30,460
This gives the mind a quick, flexible quality.

25
00:01:30,460 --> 00:01:33,010
It can see another route when the first one closes,

26
00:01:33,070 --> 00:01:35,840
sometimes before the first route has finished loading.

27
00:01:35,980 --> 00:01:39,870
Under pressure, that gift can keep reopening the decision.

28
00:01:39,870 --> 00:01:42,160
One plan becomes three tabs.

29
00:01:42,160 --> 00:01:45,420
A difficult middle gets mistaken for a sign to redesign

30
00:01:45,420 --> 00:01:48,550
