31
00:01:48,700 --> 00:01:51,340
Together, these cards create tension.

32
00:01:51,580 --> 00:01:55,360
The eight of diamonds wants traction and visible results.

33
00:01:55,500 --> 00:01:58,960
The five of clubs wants options and a fresh approach.

34
00:01:59,100 --> 00:02:02,080
One part says, make this work.

35
00:02:02,080 --> 00:02:06,640
The other says, maybe there is a completely different way.

36
00:02:06,780 --> 00:02:09,800
It can feel like pressing the gas and the brake

37
00:02:09,800 --> 00:02:12,800
