38
00:02:12,940 --> 00:02:15,840
The long range card for the current birthday to birthday

39
00:02:15,840 --> 00:02:17,740
year is the Queen of Spades.

40
00:02:17,900 --> 00:02:21,120
The Queen represents internal mastery and stewardship.

41
00:02:21,120 --> 00:02:26,480
Spades deal with work, discipline, the body, transformation and meaning.

42
00:02:26,620 --> 00:02:30,640
This year's larger theme is not simply about accomplishing more,

43
00:02:30,640 --> 00:02:34,530
it is about developing a wiser relationship with responsibility and

44
00:02:34,530 --> 00:02:38,130
change the adult version of putting the suitcase down before

45
00:02:38,130 --> 00:02:40,240
deciding which train to catch.

46
00:02:40,380 --> 00:02:43,500
The difficult side can appear as knowing a change is

47
00:02:43,500 --> 00:02:47,130
