56
00:03:15,660 --> 00:03:21,600
Jupiter deals with growth, opportunity, confidence, meaning and sometimes excess

57
00:03:21,600 --> 00:03:25,610
the cosmic version of since we are already here, should

58
00:03:25,730 --> 00:03:28,620
