59
00:03:28,710 --> 00:03:31,610
The two of spades in the birth card stream and

60
00:03:31,610 --> 00:03:34,880
the two of diamonds in the ruling card stream.

61
00:03:35,020 --> 00:03:40,620
The repeated two matters. Two is choice, polarity, partnership and

62
00:03:40,620 --> 00:03:43,930
balance. It is the card equivalent of standing in a

63
00:03:44,050 --> 00:03:47,740
doorway holding both bags. The two of spades places that

64
00:03:47,740 --> 00:03:50,700
choice inside work and transformation.

65
00:03:50,940 --> 00:03:54,520
It can look like two responsibilities, two versions of a

66
00:03:54,520 --> 00:03:57,280
