77
00:04:34,700 --> 00:04:38,220
Jupiter makes these questions feel larger.

78
00:04:38,380 --> 00:04:42,280
Opportunity and excess can arrive in the same outfit.

79
00:04:42,620 --> 00:04:45,980
The message is not to do more simply because more

80
00:04:45,980 --> 00:04:50,060
