94
00:05:38,070 --> 00:05:41,870
missing, especially the ones you have been calling just how

95
00:05:41,870 --> 00:05:46,530
it is. For the next seven days, choose one unresolved

96
00:05:46,530 --> 00:05:50,880
decision. Write down the two real options and the cost

97
00:05:50,880 --> 00:05:54,800
